  "changes": [
    "Home journey preview and Continue learning links carry a fixed Home origin. Lesson header Back, native first-card Back, completed Back and confirmed practice exit return to Home at the saved preview position. Browser/BFCache returns and late font/fragment layout also preserve that position.",
    "Next lesson keeps Home origin through consecutive roadmap lessons. Ordinary full-roadmap lessons retain their chapter anchor and exact saved roadmap position. Unknown origins fall back to the internal roadmap URL. Previous-word Back remains inside the word cards.",
    "Roadmap zigzag positioning moves only the small row children, keeping full-width fragment targets within the path. Offsets contract on narrow screens. Programmatic chapter/recommendation scrolling is vertical only and resets horizontal position to zero, preventing headings from shifting off screen.",
    "All 91 open roadmap chapters, their content and all 21 public JSON learning snapshots remain unchanged. Public version stays 1.0.0; internal version code is 33."
